{"text": "RYAN P. SCOTT\nP.O. BOX 481\nWAIMEA, KAUAI, HAWAII 96796\n(808) 337-1320\n\nIETS SOS ISI IIIS I TORII IIIT IIIA TIT IIIT III\n\n#e* OBJECTIVE ***\n\nPursuing a challenging and rewarding position\nwhere extensive experience, education and\ndemonstrated personal abilities will have\nvaluable application.\n\n\u2018#e%* EDUCATION ***\n\nAA Degree (1969) Accounting/Business Administration\nighland Community College\nFreeport, Illinois\n\nBS Degree (1971) Accounting/Business Administration\nSt. Ambrose College\nDavenport, Iowa\n\n*** CONTINUING EDUCATION ***\n\nUniversity of California - Los Angeles\nChaffey Community College - Cucamonga, Ca.\nChapman College - Orange, Ca.\nNational Society of Public Accountants\n(Cont. Educ. Srvc. Dept.)\nFederated Tax Service - Chicago, Ill.\n\nNumerous Educational & Professional seminars\nrequired throughout my professional career\n\n(Continued)",
